    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Manrope:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&family=Sora:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Manrope', sans-serif;
            background:
                radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 40% at 50% 0%, #0f2930 0%, transparent 60%),
                #04070c;
        }
        .font-display { font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif; }
    </style>
</head>

<body class="min-h-screen text-slate-200 px-6">

    <header class="mx-auto max-w-4xl py-8 flex items-center justify-between">
        <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl grid place-items-center" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#2dd4bf,#10b981)">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="2" class="w-5 h-5"><path d="M3 11h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-5Z"/><path d="M21 11h-3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v3a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h1a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-5Z"/><path d="M3 12V9a6 6 0 0 1 12 0v3"/><path d="M10 22h4"/><path d="M12 19v3"/></svg>
            </div>
            <span class="font-display font-bold text-lg">AI CallHub</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/" class="text-sm text-slate-400 hover:text-white transition">← Back to home</a>
    </header>

    <main class="mx-auto max-w-4xl pb-24">
        <h1 class="font-display text-4xl font-bold mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-12">Last updated: 2026</p>

        <div class="space-y-10 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-300">
            <section>
                <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold mb-3">1. What we collect</h2>
                <p>When you create an account, we collect your name, email address, and password (stored encrypted). When you use AI CallHub, we process call data, transcripts, and recordings that you upload or that your agents generate on your behalf.</p>
            </section>
            <section>
                <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold mb-3">2. How we use it</h2>
                <p>We use your data to run the service: create your account, train your AI agents on your knowledge base, generate transcripts and summaries, and improve product quality. We never sell your personal data.</p>
            </section>
            <section>
                <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold mb-3">3. Third-party services</h2>
                <p>The platform relies on trusted providers for core functions — including cloud hosting, database storage, language and speech AI models, and email delivery. These providers process data only to provide the service and are bound by their own security commitments.</p>
            </section>
            <section>
                <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold mb-3">4. Security</h2>
                <p>We encrypt data in transit and at rest, restrict access to named team members, and regularly review our security posture. No system is 100% secure, and we recommend you also protect your account credentials.</p>
            </section>
            <section>
                <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold mb-3">5. Your rights</h2>
                <p>You can request a copy of your data, ask us to correct it, or request deletion by contacting us. Data associated with your account can be exported or removed on request.</p>
            </section>
            <section>
                <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold mb-3">6. Contact</h2>
                <p>Questions about this policy? Email us at <a href="mailto:toheedmalik321@gmail.com" class="text-teal-300 hover:text-teal-200">toheedmalik321@gmail.com</a>.</p>
            </section>
        </div>
    </main>

</body>

</html>